"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Limit vitès, koneksyon pou chak torent, espas pou enpòte ak seeding yo mete pou chak torent lè ou ajoute l, oswa pita anba Paramèt torent. Torent yo itilize pwoksimite nan tab Koneksyon (HTTP oswa SOCKS5, oswa pwoksimite Mac la ak \"Itilizasyon paramèt sistèm\") ak limit vitès pou tout telechaje. Chanjman yo aplike pou torent ki kòmanse apre sa. Peers ak trackers ka wè adrès IP ou, oswa adrès proxy ou.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Konfigurasyon ki itilize pou chak telechaje soti nan yon sit entènèt. Yon sit wèb kouvri tou subdomains li yo (example.com kouvri www.example.com). Logins yo se sèlman voye nan sit la epi yo rete ak lòt sekrè aplikasyon an.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Yon sauvegarde kenbe konfiguration ou, konfiguration sit, queues ak lis téléchargements. Mot de passe ak cookies yo pa janm mete nan yon sauvegarde.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Lè ou kopye yon lyen ki fini nan youn nan kalite sa yo, fenèt Ajoute a louvri avèk li.";
