"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Sauvegarde dosye a extension, louvri paj la navigatè a extensions, vire sou mòd Developer, chwazi Load unpacked ak chwazi dosye a.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Enskri dosye a ajoute-on epi glise li sou yon fenèt Firefox. Firefox enstale ajoute-on ki siyen; gade README pou siyen kopi ou a.";
